## Change 4 — `src/app/man/admin/dashboard/[submissionId]/page.tsx`

**What:** After triggering generation, redirect directly to the report review page instead of staying on the submission detail page.

Currently `handleGenerate()` does:
```typescript
const res = await fetch(`/api/man-report/generate/${submissionId}`, { method: 'POST' });
await load(); // re-fetches submission detail
```

Change to:
```typescript
const res  = await fetch(`/api/man-report/generate/${submissionId}`, { method: 'POST' });
const data = await res.json();
if (data.reportId) router.push(`/man/admin/report/${data.reportId}`);
```

The admin lands directly on the report review page, which starts polling and shows sections as they appear. They never have to stay on the "status banner" page.

