## Execution Order

1. **`manReportGenerator.ts`** — add the 6 per-section exports  
2. **`generate/route.ts`** — rewrite `runPipeline()` to call them sequentially with per-section DB writes  
3. **`admin/report/page.tsx`** — polling, skeleton states, live indicator, remove generating gate  
4. **`admin/dashboard/[submissionId]/page.tsx`** — redirect after trigger  

